{"4172400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Desperate Civilization", "steam_appid": 4172400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172400/extras/1f01b89cd38a84acce43654f0876c554.avif?t=1787275705\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172400/extras_big/1f01b89cd38a84acce43654f0876c554.avif?t=1787275705 width=1560 height=624 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the nuclear catastrophe of 2123, the Earth has become a desolate radioactive wasteland. Ninety percent of humanity perished and civilization collapsed. Survivors survived in space bases. With radiation fading away, you are sent back to the barren Earth to complete high-risk resource exploration missions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or team up with up to 6 players. Traverse the dangerous wasteland together, avoid threats, collect supplies and increase your extraction success rate through teamwork.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172400/extras/cca88c9c93725949f3970b570045bf2f.avif?t=1787275705\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172400/extras_big/cca88c9c93725949f3970b570045bf2f.avif?t=1787275705 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Random Extraction Rules</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dangerous irradiated mutants wander the ruins. Evade enemies and scavenge precious human relics. Every match features unique random extraction objectives, bringing brand-new survival challenges for every run.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172400/extras/92f163b2b704209b2cbf646fa1dccfb8.avif?t=1787275705\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172400/extras_big/92f163b2b704209b2cbf646fa1dccfb8.avif?t=1787275705 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Progression System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extract safely to convert collected loot into funds. Unlock and upgrade equipment continuously, improve your survival abilities, take on tougher missions and survive in this desperate apocalyptic world.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172400/extras/28a6e94e7f05f1845a7211d10b2af0e4.avif?t=1787275705\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172400/extras_big/28a6e94e7f05f1845a7211d10b2af0e4.avif?t=1787275705 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172400/extras/1f01b89cd38a84acce43654f0876c554.avif?t=1787275705\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172400/extras_big/1f01b89cd38a84acce43654f0876c554.avif?t=1787275705 width=1560 height=624 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the nuclear catastrophe of 2123, the Earth has become a desolate radioactive wasteland. Ninety percent of humanity perished and civilization collapsed. Survivors survived in space bases. With radiation fading away, you are sent back to the barren Earth to complete high-risk resource exploration missions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or team up with up to 6 players. Traverse the dangerous wasteland together, avoid threats, collect supplies and increase your extraction success rate through teamwork.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172400/extras/cca88c9c93725949f3970b570045bf2f.avif?t=1787275705\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172400/extras_big/cca88c9c93725949f3970b570045bf2f.avif?t=1787275705 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Random Extraction Rules</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dangerous irradiated mutants wander the ruins. Evade enemies and scavenge precious human relics. Every match features unique random extraction objectives, bringing brand-new survival challenges for every run.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172400/extras/92f163b2b704209b2cbf646fa1dccfb8.avif?t=1787275705\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172400/extras_big/92f163b2b704209b2cbf646fa1dccfb8.avif?t=1787275705 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Progression System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extract safely to convert collected loot into funds. Unlock and upgrade equipment continuously, improve your survival abilities, take on tougher missions and survive in this desperate apocalyptic world.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172400/extras/28a6e94e7f05f1845a7211d10b2af0e4.avif?t=1787275705\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172400/extras_big/28a6e94e7f05f1845a7211d10b2af0e4.avif?t=1787275705 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Multiplayer post-nuclear survival game set in 2123, support up to 6 players. Return to irradiated Earth from space outpost, evade mutated creatures and loot valuable relics. Complete random extraction objectives, cash in loots to buy gear for future expeditions.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italia